## Technical Improvements
- **Stable Layout**: Navigation controls are now anchored at a fixed bottom position, preventing UI jumpiness between steps.
- **Persistent State**: Non-canvas objects (equations, text) now persist correctly across beats until explicitly removed.
- **Robust Rendering**: Repaired the rendering loop to ensure added objects are in the DOM before animations start.
